     because the extract holds no instance of their road layouts (README.md beside
     this file, "#253's cases"). Every id is 9000000000000000000 or above, a range
     OpenStreetMap's ids cannot reach; every way and relation carries a note saying
     so. They lie in the Kattegat, more than 35 km from every other object of the
     extract, joined to nothing else. -->
